    <h1>Terms and permitted use</h1>
    <div class="notice-placeholder"><strong>Not legal terms.</strong> A deployment operator must replace this project notice with terms reviewed for the organization, users, and jurisdiction.</div>

    <h2>Demonstration software</h2>
    <p>CareAxis is a software demonstration of appointment, clinician, account, and record workflows. It is not a clinical decision-support system, emergency service, medical advice service, or substitute for professional care.</p>

    <h2>Before using a deployed instance</h2>
    <p>The operator must define account eligibility, acceptable use, data ownership, retention and deletion practices, incident handling, service availability, and any clinical or administrative responsibilities. Do not submit real health information until the instance has been assessed and approved for that purpose.</p>

    <h2>Emergency care</h2>
    <p>Do not use this application to request urgent care. For an emergency, contact local emergency services or an appropriate qualified provider.</p>
